{"id":"fd4992ce7beaa916","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-pspace-fo-pfp.md","title":"PSPACE=FO(PFP)","display":"thm-pspace-fo-pfp — PSPACE=FO(PFP)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-pspace-fo-pfp","aliases":["29-thm-pspace-fo-pfp"],"display":"thm-pspace-fo-pfp — PSPACE=FO(PFP)","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-iteration]]","[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","[[29-df-fo-pfp]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 10.13, p.161, DjVu scan 176","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-pspace-fo-pfp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-pspace-fo-pfp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pspace-fo-pfp — PSPACE=FO(PFP)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"95fd0348476d19cc\" href=\"?note=95fd0348476d19cc\" title=\"29-df-fo-iteration\">29-df-fo-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f21a81def92d642\" href=\"?note=9f21a81def92d642\" title=\"29-df-fo-pfp\">29-df-fo-pfp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 10.13, p.161, DjVu scan 176"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，不含保留数值关系或常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},\\mathrm{BIT},\\mathrm{PLUS},\\mathrm{TIMES},0,1,\\max\">\\(&lt;,\\mathrm{SUC},\\mathrm{BIT},\\mathrm{PLUS},\\mathrm{TIMES},0,1,\\max\\)</span>；所有查询在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 上取值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{FO(PFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{FO(PFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"95fd0348476d19cc\" href=\"?note=95fd0348476d19cc\" title=\"29-df-fo-iteration\">29-df-fo-iteration</a> 的指数轮数量词块查询类，实际满足关系作用于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a> 的标准数值扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau(U)\">\\(E_\\tau(U)\\)</span>。由于保留符号均不在输入词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau=\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau=\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\">\\(n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{FO(PFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]=\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PSPACE}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{FO(PFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]=\\mathrm{FO}[2^{n^{O(1)}},\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>核对原书陈述与相邻证明说明，未完整重验并行模拟。</p>\n<p>本轮补回原书 Theorem 10.13 的第三项指数轮数量词块刻画。输入词汇与保留数值符号分开后，三项都是同一有序对论域上的查询类；指数族并集已由 FO-iteration 显式展开。FO(PFP) 仅用对象序也可定义所需数值关系，因此与带标准数值扩张的量词块比较不增加机器查询能力。上界保存固定数量的关系状态与指数计时器，反向以停机多项式空间机器的指数个配置作量词块模拟；原书三项证明结构已对照，全部位级模拟仍未逐式重验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"95fd0348476d19cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-pfp","status":"resolved","id":"9f21a81def92d642","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-pfp]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep